# Local IPOs: a company's price moves once it trades. During the offering it stands at the
# offering price; from the day after its first trading day it closes at a different price every
# day, like the game's own stocks. Everything listed is removed in cleanup.
name local ipos: a trading company's price moves every day
local-ipos on
# only businesses healthy today are candidates (the city's own counts come back at the end)
ipo-forget
ipo-healthy-days 1
ipo-scan
ipo-list-now
expect-company offering listed
ipo-first-day
expect-company trading listed
run-days 5
expect-company-moving 4
show-economy
wait 1.5
capture ipo-price-moves
cleanup:
close-economy
ipo-remove-test
local-ipos restore
